290","kind":"announcement","title":"🏆 TERRACLYSM SURVIVORS DEMO RANKING PRIZES! 🏆","summary":"The demo leaderboard has just been reset! 🔥 This is your chance to start fresh, climb the rankings, and compete for some awesome rewards! 🎉 Check out the prizes:🥇 1ST PLACE — $50 USD + 9 GAMES!🥈 2ND PLACE — 6 GAMES!🥉 3RD PLACE — 3 GAMES! That's 18 games up for grabs, featuring amazing titles from talented indie developers! ⏰ The ranking ends on October 26 at 06:59 AM UTC! Think you have what it takes to reach the top? 💪 Jump into the demo, set your best score, and fight your way up the leaderboa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T22:20:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692932","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4360290-1841579228662128","game_id":"steam-4360290","kind":"update","title":"Terraclysm Survivors Demo Update","summary":"Hello, everyone! Today we bring a major update, improving many aspects of the game, including performance, mechanics, and multiplayer.We now have greater stability in player synchronization, more consistent performance, and mechanic improvements for smoother gameplay.Item: Some items were not having their status removed when unequippedItem: Unique items appearing to be picked up more than onceItem: Fix for the harvest scytheItem: Fix for the item that couldn't be bought or picked up from the gro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T10:16:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228662128","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4360290-1835236783556387","game_id":"steam-4360290","kind":"announcement","title":"Terraclysm Survivors Multiplayer Demo Available!","summary":"The Group Apocalypse Starts Today – Terraclysm Survivors Multiplayer Demo Available! The multiplayer is finally here! Now you can join your friends and take on the great challenge of facing the apocalypse together.Multiplayer: Create P2P rooms to play with your friends.Localization: Japanese and Korean now available.⚔️ Play the demo with your friends and tell us what you think. Your feedback will help shape the future of the game.A small message from the team ❤️ This is the first time we've made","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-10T02:41:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783556387","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4360290-1834602721200144","game_id":"steam-4360290","kind":"announcement","title":"Terraclysm Survivors Demo Available Now!","summary":"The Apocalypse Begins Today – Terraclysm Survivors Demo Available Now!The wait is over!The Terraclysm Survivors demo is now live on Steam, and the first signs of the apocalypse have arrived.Step into a world devastated by celestial horrors, battle terrifying creatures inspired by apocalyptic myths, experiment with powerful builds, and see how long you can survive against the forces descending from the heavens.Whether you're here to challenge the Biblically Accurate Angels, uncover the mysteries ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T20:34:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721200144","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4360290":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:12:21Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:12:21Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4360290":"2